   "titulo": "Der or som",
   "texto": [
    "When the highlighted element is the subject, **der** and **som**: **Det var Lars, der/som ringede.** are possible if it is object, **som** is usually used, which can be omitted: **Det var bogen, (som) jeg købte.** With time or place, the marker can also be omitted: **Det var i går, vi mødtes.** = It was yesterday when we saw each other."
